Written for lane w4-macro: approx's assertion macros (`assert_abs_diff_eq!`, `assert_relative_eq!`) imported by `use approx::..` or invoked as `approx::..!`, as bevy_math's tests do. The approx crate sits under vendor/, which the indexer skips, so its macro_rules! are invisible as a dependency's are. Calls and operators in the arguments print their backtrace (the run is the truth); the unimported `assert_relative_eq!` in `local` names a module-local macro_rules! whose transcriber drops its argument.
